// bench/alloc/grow_free.raw.an — 增长-释放循环 (裸态): 与 grow_free.an 同算法,
// 元素类型是 T* (裸态没有切片).
//
// 规模: 40 轮 × 4096 个 4 KiB 块 (每轮 16 MiB).
// 断言: checksum == 每块写入值 7 × 块数 × 轮数.

from std.core.io import print;

fn main() {
    let cycles: u64 = 40;
    let chunk_count: u64 = 4096;
    let checksum: i64 = 0;

    let cycle: u64 = 0;
    while cycle < cycles {
        let batch = dyn[chunk_count] u8*;
        let i: u64 = 0;
        while i < chunk_count {
            batch[i] = dyn[4096] u8;
            batch[i][0] = 7;
            checksum += i64(batch[i][0]);
            i += 1;
        }
        let j: u64 = 0;
        while j < chunk_count {
            let chunk: u8* = batch[j];
            del chunk;
            j += 1;
        }
        del batch;
        cycle += 1;
    }

    assert checksum == i64(chunk_count) * i64(cycles) * 7: "grow/free checksum";
    print("grow pass\n");
}
